Author: Fervi (IntinteDAO) <lordfervi@protonmail.com>
Subject: Build: resolve failure with OneTBB
Description: OneTBB requires const arguments for the comparison function.
Origin: upstream, commit:af82c3ca2d0f94978bc8b4178c623fbed9767068
Forwarded: not-needed

--- a/source/blender/modifiers/intern/MOD_grease_pencil_build.cc
+++ b/source/blender/modifiers/intern/MOD_grease_pencil_build.cc
@@ -471,3 +471,3 @@
   parallel_sort(
-      distances.begin(), distances.end(), [](Pair &a, Pair &b) { return a.value < b.value; });
+      distances.begin(), distances.end(), [](const Pair &a, const Pair &b) { return a.value < b.value; });
 
